  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### Is there a way to see all customers together on the ageing list?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 25 Nov, 2021 at 12:54 PM\n\n\t\tNavigation: Bookkeeping > Select Client > Reports > Customers\n\nWe recommend you click on the below link to view the list of all debtors (select All in the customer field) and then you have to export to excel. Once it is exported then you can check the Due balances for Paid or Unpaid.\n\nClick here to watch how to view / export a full customer ageing list\n\nBookkeeping>>Reports\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Is there a way to see all customers together on the ageing list?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 25 Nov, 2021 at 12:54 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Navigation:</strong> Bookkeeping &gt; Select Client &gt; Reports &gt; Customers</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We recommend you click on the below link to view the list of all debtors (select All in the customer field) and then you have to export to excel. Once it is exported then you can check the Due balances for Paid or Unpaid.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/dbcd43cb583d43f88d3ad79a5249d04f\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to view / export a full customer ageing list</span></strong></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"http://url:https://app.capium.com/bookkeeping/reports/aginglist.aspx?type=Customer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Bookkeeping&gt;&gt;Reports</strong></span></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.fre